    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paper Kingdom is a colony management game. Starting as a nomadic tribe your job is to turn your settlement into an empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gather resources from cards like Forest, Quarry, Mine and Sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Craft items and assign jobs for your settlers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build structures to progress your settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Produce goods and trade them for Coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Handle dynamic game events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore new cards and fight off invaders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930390/extras/cd9413125b86adaa38c9f3b5776aa658.avif?t=1740508643\" /></div></p>",
